cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GLPlot: GPU-accelerated interactive scientific visualization with a Matplotlib-like interface"
message: >-
  If you use GLPlot in your research, please cite the GLPlot paper below (the "preferred
  citation"); to point at the exact software version you used, cite this repository as well.
  Felix Riccius, Julian Holland and Gianmarco Ducci contributed equally to this work.
